{"id":"a3s3","label":"Act 3, Scene 3","group":"Act 3","blocks":[{"k":"d","text":"The passage leading to Volpone’s chamber."},{"k":"d","text":"Enter Mosca and Bonario."},{"k":"s","text":"MOS"},{"k":"v","lines":["Sir, here conceal’d,"]},{"k":"d","text":"Shews him a closet."},{"k":"v","lines":["you may here all. But, pray you,","Have patience, sir;"]},{"k":"d","text":"Knocking within."},{"k":"v","lines":["—the same’s your father knocks:","I am compell’d to leave you."]},{"k":"d","text":"Exit."},{"k":"s","text":"BON"},{"k":"v","lines":["Do so.—Yet,","Cannot my thought imagine this a truth."]},{"k":"d","text":"Goes into the closet."}]}